  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">CORE &amp; DREF FUNDS TO IFRC 2025</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This grant combines core funding to the IFRC and flexible funding to the IFRC&apos;s Disaster Response Emergency Fund (DREF).Core funding will support the IFRC to deliver its humanitarian goals including through the continued development of strong National Societies, effective Federation-wide coordination and successful humanitarian diplomacy, while funding to the DREF supports Societies to save lives and livelihoods by acting before, during and after disaster hits, including via anticipatory action.</narrative>
  </description>
